# Milestones — {{ project_name }}

Per-milestone status documents live here. Each milestone gets one file when it
opens, updated as work progresses, and archived when the milestone closes.

## Conventions

- File naming: `M<N>-<slug>.md` (e.g. `M0-foundation.md`).
- Each milestone doc states: goal, scope, exit criteria, current status,
  links to PRDs/epics/issues, and a short retrospective pointer when closed.
- The authoritative *plan* (the full milestone list and ordering) lives in the
  project's master plan document, not here. This folder holds per-milestone
  status only.
